---
---
<section class="case-study">
    <div class="case-grid">
        <div class="case-image"></div>
        <div class="case-text">
            <h4>Impact Study</h4>
            <h2>The cost of a wrong turn.</h2>
            <p>A client was told surgery was their only option following a cancer recurrence. By identifying a clinical trial at a major cancer center, I coordinated a second opinion within two weeks.</p>
            <div class="metrics">
                <div class="metric-item">
                    <span class="metric-value">$180k</span>
                    <small>Surgery Saved</small>
                </div>
                <div class="metric-item">
                    <span class="metric-value">6 Mos</span>
                    <small>Recovery Avoided</small>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pull-quote">
            "In a complex healthcare landscape, having an expert clinician on your side ensures that nothing is left to chance."
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .case-study {
        padding: 10rem 5%;
        background: var(--bg-beige);
    }

    .case-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;
        gap: 6rem;
        align-items: center;
    }

    .case-image {
        width: 100%;
        height: 600px;
        background: url('desk-compass.jpg') center/cover;
        box-shadow: -20px 20px 0 var(--white);
    }

    .case-text h4 {
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 3px;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
        color: var(--text-dark);
    }

    .case-text h2 {
        font-size: 3.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        line-height: 1.1;
    }

    .case-text p {
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .metrics {
        display: flex;
        gap: 3rem;
    }

    .metric-value {
        font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        color: var(--royal-blue);
        line-height: 1;
    }

    .metric-item small {
        text-transform: uppercase;
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
        display: block;
        margin-top: 0.5rem;
        color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .pull-quote {
        grid-column: 1 / 3;
        text-align: center;
        margin: 6rem auto 0;
        max-width: 900px;
        font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        font-style: italic;
        line-height: 1.3;
        color: var(--royal-blue);
    }

    .pull-quote::after {
        content: "";
        display: block;
        width: 60px;
        height: 1px;
        background: var(--royal-blue);
        margin: 2rem auto 0;
    }

    /* Tablet and Mobile Breakpoint */
    @media (max-width: 960px) {
        .case-study {
            padding: 4rem 5%;
        }
        .case-grid {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 3rem;
        }
        .case-image {
            height: 350px;
            box-shadow: none;
        }
        .case-text h2 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        .pull-quote {
            grid-column: 1;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            margin-top: 2rem;
        }
    }
</style>